Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-04",
  "weight_kg": 70.5,
  "notes": "Morning weigh-in"
}

### Create Measurement Log
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/measurements/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-08-04",
  "waist_cm": 80,
  "hips_cm": 100,
  "chest_cm": 95,
  "thigh_cm": 60,
